		<title level="m" type="main">LLMs&apos; empathy capabilities. Recent investigations into LLMs&apos; empathy capabilities yield insightful findings. Sorin et al. [41] reviewed the literature on the capacity of LLMs in demonstrating empathy. Zhu et al. [47] investigated the use of LLMs for performing mental inference tasks, specifically inferring users&apos; underlying goals and fundamental psychological needs</title>
