	<note>Jiang et al. [23] highlighted GPT-3.5&apos;s unexpected empathetic reactions</note>
</biblStruct>

<biblStruct xml:id="b1">
	<monogr>
		<title level="m" type="main">&apos;s skill in predicting human emotions. Lee et al. [27] explored GPT-3&apos;s empathetic dialogue generation via in-context learning. Del Arco et al. [16] acknowledged GPT-3&apos;s role in empathy and distress predictions</title>
